Comment: Source files that are not used in this build are excluded. The bundled
 dependencies listed here are replaced by their Debian packages; see the
 -DUSE_HTSLIB, -DUSE_LIBFMT and -DUSE_CONCURRENT_QUEUE flags in debian/rules.
 This list must be kept in step with the filter in
 packing/sh.d/prepare-orig-tgz-for-deb.sh, which is what actually builds the
 orig tarball.

